### [A-TC01] Get all available boxes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes

### [A-TC02] Get box by exact name (Matcha Lover Box)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/boxname/Matcha Lover Box

### [A-TC03] Get all items from all boxes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/items

### [A-TC04] Create a new box with full item list (valid)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boxName": "Japanese Snack Box",
  "boxPrice": 59,
  "items": [
    { "itemName": "Tokyo Banana", "itemPrice": 85, "itemAmount": 4 },
    { "itemName": "Matcha Pocky", "itemPrice": 45, "itemAmount": 6 },
    { "itemName": "Yuzu Citrus Candy", "itemPrice": 50, "itemAmount": 5 },
    { "itemName": "Shiroi Koibito Cookies", "itemPrice": 90, "itemAmount": 3 },
    { "itemName": "Ume Plum Rice Crackers", "itemPrice": 65, "itemAmount": 4 }
  ]
}

### [A-TC05] Create a box with empty item list
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boxName": "Empty Box",
  "boxPrice": 10,
  "items": []
}

### [A-TC06] Create a box with missing fields (invalid payload)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boxName": "Invalid Box"
}

### [A-TC07] Update and delete items with valid actions
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/items/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "itemId": 3, "action": "delete" },
  { "itemId": 4, "action": "update", "deltaAmount": -2 },
  { "itemId": 5, "action": "update", "deltaAmount": 1000 }
]

### [A-TC08] Update item with invalid action keyword
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/items/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "itemId": 5, "action": "explode" }
]

### [A-TC09] Update non-existent itemId
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/items/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "itemId": 9999, "action": "update", "deltaAmount": 2 }
]

### [A-TC10] Delete box by valid ID (expect deleted + remaining boxes)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/1
Accept: application/json

### [A-TC11] Delete non-existent box by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/9999

### [A-TC12] Delete with invalid ID type (string instead of number)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/abc